Package: tennisage
Title: Plot Tennis Players' Career Ages from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zacharia", "Makari", email = "zacharia.makari@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads a tennis player's career matches from tennisabstract.com
    and plots the player's age against the age difference with each opponent.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, ggplot2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
